msgid "Detected an <1>Oeno by Vintec</1> export. Each cabinet (and each column of a multi-column cabinet) in your CSV becomes one rack: a Wine cabinet when the file shows stacked rows, an Open Shelf when it shows a front and a back row, shaped from the shelves, layers and slots the file describes (shelf 1 at the bottom). Each bottle's exact cell is preserved — adjust the shape below only if a cabinet has more shelves than the file shows."
